# Copy to .dev.vars for `wrangler dev`. In production REPOSITORIES is set on the deployed Worker, see the README.

# JSON object mapping repository patterns to the secret token of their GitHub webhook
# and the Discord webhooks the events are sent to.
# Patterns may contain "*" wildcards, and every matching pattern with a valid secret fires.
REPOSITORIES='{"xPaw/GitHub-WebHook":{"secret":"hunter2","webhooks":["https://discord.com/api/webhooks/123/abc"]},"SteamDatabase/*":{"secret":"correct horse","webhooks":["https://discord.com/api/webhooks/456/def"]}}'
